  (text "FUNCTION\n\n1) 555 astable (RV1 = rate) clocks 74HC161\n2) Q0..Q3 drive S0..S3 into TT uio[3:0]\n3) Sequence: S=0,1,2,...15,0,... (one function after another)\n4) DIP A/B + SW M/Cn_n hold operands/mode\n5) LEDs show F[3:0] and AeqB from uo_*\n\nPower: 3V3/GND from Tiny Tapeout demo board.\nComplete netlist: SCHEMATIC.md + connections.csv + bom.csv\nPlace symbols (NE555, 74HC161, DIP, headers, LEDs) from KiCad\nstandard libraries, then route a 2-layer board ~50x50mm."
